flowchart TB
  FAULT["<b>ONE IDENTICAL INJECTED FAULT</b> · tier2_toxicity raises DetectorTimeout"]
  SYN["<b>the gateway records one failure event</b> · detector, error_class, fail_mode_applied<br/><i>an operational event — never a content Signal, so it cannot look like a risk finding</i>"]
  LOOKUP{"<b>look up fail_mode for that detector class, in THIS use case's own policy</b>"}
  O1["<b>support_bot — fail_open</b><br/>log and count the failure,<br/>then proceed without that detector's signals"]
  C1["<b>finance_advisor — fail_closed</b><br/>the synthesized failure maps to ESCALATE,<br/><i>never a silent BLOCK — a human sees why</i>"]
  O2["<b>RESPONSE PASSES</b><br/>failure recorded in the audit trail<br/><i>availability over strictness</i>"]
  C2["<b>RESPONSE QUARANTINED</b><br/>review item labelled detector_failure<br/><i>caution over availability</i>"]
  NOTE["<i>Same fault. Same code. Same engine. One different line of YAML.</i>"]

  FAULT --> SYN --> LOOKUP
